rse political environment within Ruginienée's premiership. LSDP's containment machinery is functioning but operating at capacity. Key watchpoints for the next two weeks: (1) PPNA coalition decision — now approaching with both FNTT investigation of Žemaitaitis AND Jukna scandal active; June 10 court ruling (VRK challenge) as proximate trigger; (2) government emergency declaration on balloon campaign — what authorities does it activate, what international response follows; (3) Ukrainian drone crash follow-up — origin confirmation, NATO consultation; (4) Hormuz mission status — does State Defence Council meet before end of May; (5) Jukna investigation scope — does it establish PM knowledge of arrangement.",
